WEBVTT

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:01.620
Alex, you're up.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.360
Right. So...

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.450
Perfect.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.710
We need to... optimize our...

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:22.130
We need to optimize our

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:24.450
cross-functional onboarding experience.

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.260
That's... a lot of words.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.900
I remember having no idea who to ask.

00:00:35.270 --> 00:00:36.900
New teammates need a clear first step.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:38.340
A clear first step.

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:44.780
So you know where to start—and who to ask.

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:51.910
A simple checklist, and a buddy.

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:56.080
What if their buddy's busy?

00:00:58.610 --> 00:00:59.840
Then a backup.

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:01.560
No one should be stuck waiting.

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:05.730
I could've used that on my first day.

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:10.610
Me too.

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:15.600
Tingbo. Hear it. Make it yours.
